sequenceDiagram
 participant C as Cliente/curl
 participant K as Kernel TCP
 participant S as tcp_web_server.py
 C->>K: connect(host, port)
 K-->>C: SYN/SYN-ACK/ACK (three-way handshake)
 K->>S: accept() entrega socket estabelecido
 C->>S: bytes HTTP GET /healthz CRLF
 S->>S: parse_request + roteamento
 S-->>C: HTTP/1.1 200, headers, body
 S->>K: close()/FIN
 K-->>C: ACK/FIN e encerramento TCP
